ata-s=\"2\" data-w=\"16\">how</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"17\">to</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"18\">avoid</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"19\">fooling</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"20\">yourself.</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"3\">same</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"4\">skill</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"5\">you</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"6\">will</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"7\">need</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"8\">to</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"9\">evaluate</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"10\">an</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"11\">LLM</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"12\">system.</span></p>\n<p><em><span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"0\">This</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"1\">chapter</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"3\">almost</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"4\">entirely</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"5\">beyond</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"7\">videos.</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"1\">comes</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"2\">from</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"3\">standard</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"4\">practice</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"5\">and</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"7\">scikit-learn</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"8\">documentation.</span></em></p>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"0\">Key</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"1\">ideas</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"0\">Accuracy</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"1\">can</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"2\">look</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"3\">great</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"4\">while</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"6\">model</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"8\">useless,</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"9\">whenever</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"10\">one</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"11\">class</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"12\">is</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"13\">rare.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"1\">confusion</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"2\">matrix</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"3\">counts</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"5\">four</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"6\">kinds</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"7\">of</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"8\">outcome.</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"0\">Precision</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"1\">and</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"2\">recall</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"3\">each</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"4\">summarize</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"5\">one</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"6\">kind</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"7\">of</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"8\">error.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"1\">threshold</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"2\">trades</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"3\">precision</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"4\">for</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"5\">recall.</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"0\">Choose</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"1\">it</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"2\">with</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"4\">real</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"5\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"6\">of</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"7\">each</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"8\">mistake.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"0\">Evaluate</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"1\">on</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"2\">data</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"4\">model</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"5\">has</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"6\">not</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"7\">seen,</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"8\">with</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"9\">cross-validation</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"10\">for</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"11\">small</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"12\">datasets</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"13\">and</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"14\">date-based</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"15\">splits</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"16\">for</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"17\">time-ordered</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"18\">ones.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"1\">predicted</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"2\">probability</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"3\">should</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"4\">match</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"5\">reality</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"6\">(calibration)</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"7\">when</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"8\">decisions</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"9\">depend</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"10\">on</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"11\">it.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"h-121-why-accuracy-lies\"><span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"0\">12.1</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"1\">Why</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"2\">accuracy</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"3\">lies</span></h4>\n<p><span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"0\">Take</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"1\">1,000</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"2\">loans,</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"3\">of</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"4\">which</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"5\">50</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"6\">defaulted.</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"1\">\"model\"</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"2\">that</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"3\">predicts</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"4\">\"no</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"5\">default\"</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"6\">for</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"7\">everyone</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"8\">is</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"9\">95%</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"10\">accurate</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"12\">catches</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"13\">no</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"14\">defaulter</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"15\">at</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"16\">all.</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"0\">Accuracy</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"1\">hides</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"3\">thing</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"4\">you</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"5\">care</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"6\">about,</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"7\">because</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"8\">defaults</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"9\">are</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"10\">rare.</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"0\">Whenever</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"1\">classes</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"2\">are</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"3\">imbalanced</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"4\">(fraud,</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"5\">defaults,</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"6\">rare</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"7\">diseases),</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"8\">look</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"9\">at</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"11\">next</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"12\">measures</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"13\">instead.</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-122-the-confusion-matrix\"><span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"0\">12.2</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"1\">The</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"2\">confusion</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"3\">matrix</span></h4>\n<p><span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"0\">Suppose</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"2\">model</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"3\">flags</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"4\">60</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"5\">loans</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"6\">as</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"7\">risky.</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"0\">Of</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"1\">its</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"2\">60</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"3\">flags,</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"4\">35</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"5\">really</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"6\">were</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"7\">defaults</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"9\">25</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"10\">were</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"11\">good</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"12\">loans</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"13\">flagged</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"14\">by</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"15\">mistake.</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"1\">missed</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"2\">15</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"3\">defaults.</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"0\">Everything</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"1\">else,</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"2\">925</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"3\">loans,</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"4\">was</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"5\">correctly</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"6\">left</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"7\">alone.</span></p>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Predicted: default</th>\n<th>Predicted: no default</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Actually default</strong></td>\n<td>35 (true positives, TP)</td>\n<td>15 (false negatives, FN)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Actually no default</strong></td>\n<td>25 (false positives, FP)</td>\n<td>925 (true negatives, TN)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>Measure</th>\n<th>Formula</th>\n<th>Here</th>\n<th>In words</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>Accuracy</td>\n<td>(TP + TN) / all</td>\n<td>96%</td>\n<td>share of all answers that are right (the \"always no\" model gets 95%)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Precision</td>\n<td>TP / (TP + FP)</td>\n<td>58.3%</td>\n<td>of the loans I flagged, how many really were defaults</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Recall (sensitivity)</td>\n<td>TP / (TP + FN)</td>\n<td>70%</td>\n<td>of the real defaults, how many I caught</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Specificity</td>\n<td>TN / (TN + FP)</td>\n<td>97.4%</td>\n<td>of the good loans, how many I left alone</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F1</td>\n<td>2 x precision x recall / (precision + recall)</td>\n<td>0.636</td>\n<td>one number that is high only when both are high</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.metrics import confusion_matrix, precision_score, recall_score, f1_score, accuracy_score\n\ny_true = np.array([1] * 50 + [0] * 950)                         # 1,000 loans, 50 defaulted\ny_pred = np.array([1] * 35 + [0] * 15 + [1] * 25 + [0] * 925)   # flagged 35 of the 50, plus 25 good loans by mistake\n\nprint(confusion_matrix(y_true, y_pred))\n# [[925  25]\n#  [ 15  35]]     rows = truth (0, 1), columns = prediction (0, 1)\nprint(accuracy_score(y_true, y_pred), round(precision_score(y_true, y_pred), 3),\n      recall_score(y_true, y_pred), round(f1_score(y_true, y_pred), 3))   # 0.96 0.583 0.7 0.636\nprint(accuracy_score(y_true, np.zeros(1000)), recall_score(y_true, np.zeros(1000)))   # 0.95 0.0  always \"no default\"\n</code></pre>\n<p><span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"1\">\"always</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"2\">no</spa